00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Yes, I Do is a romance, tv movie film directed by Christie Will Wolf.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Busy chocolatier Charlotte has left her boyfriend James at the altar three times and
now she needs to prove to him that she really does want to marry him.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Things are complicated when James’ ex-girlfriend Nicole, who is also the owner of
Chocolate Monthly Magazine, arrives on the scene and says she wants him back.

