00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Yes Day is a 2021 American family comedy film directed by Miguel Arteta, from a screenplay and screen story by Justin
Malen, based upon the children's book of the same name by Amy Krouse Rosenthal and Tom Lichtenheld.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
It stars Jennifer Garner, Édgar Ramírez, and Jenna Ortega.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The movie was released on March 12, 2021 on Netflix.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
It received mixed reviews from critics, who praised the acting
(particularly that of Ortega) but criticized its writing and humor.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
At the 2021 Imagen Awards, Ortega was nominated
for Best Actress in a Feature Film.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
A sequel is in development.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The film explores themes of ex-girlfriend, chocolaterie,
business woman, canceled wedding, wedding plans.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The tone is emotional.
